\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Jesus my Saviour, The son of God,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 truly is risen from the dead,
\par death, sin and darkness are conquered,
\par and brought us safely, to His kingdom.
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj\i 
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\i0\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj\i0 Death has no dominion over Christ
\par and no sin ever cover Him
\par and has won the greatest battle
\par that  all mankind shall give Him praise
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. That Jesus Christ is still alive,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 and gives His children care and love,
\par and we shall never be afraid
\par of  death's  sting and darkness of hell
\par 
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj\i0 Death has no power over Christ
\par and no sin ever cover Him
\par and has won the greatest battle
\par that  all mankind shall give Him praise
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. He loves and gives me all that care
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 and gives me comfort when'er in need.
\par And in my death He shall take me
\par up to His Kingdom of Heaven.
\par 
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj\i0 Death has no power over Christ
\par and no sin ever cover Him
\par and has won the greatest battle
\par that  all mankind shall give Him praise
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. By this assurance in my mind
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 I need to give my praise to Christ
\par That in my heart and in my life
\par I shall through death get unto heav'n.
\par \pard\li144\sl202\slmult0\i   \i0 
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj\i0 Death has no power over Christ
\par and no sin ever cover Him
\par and has won the greatest battle
\par that  all mankind shall give Him praise\cf1\ul\b\f1 
